  "body": [
    {
      "id": "p-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Now subtract instead of add. A half subtractor computes A minus B for two single bits, producing a DIFFERENCE and a BORROW, and it mirrors the half adder closely enough to build by editing a copy."
        }
      ]
    },
